[en.FOCUS_C12_RECRUIT_MINERS]
Recruit miners

[en.FOCUS_C12_RECRUIT_MINERS_desc]
Once, many sturdy ponies, pressed by their livelihoods, chose to descend into the mines as miners. As long as we can provide suitable compensation, these ponies would agree to fight for harmony once again. Their physique would make them the finest soldiers.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_RECRUIT_MINERS]
征募矿工

[zh.FOCUS_C12_RECRUIT_MINERS_desc]
曾经许多健壮的小马迫于生计，选择下井当一名矿工，只要我们能提供合适的报酬，这些小马会同意重新为谐律而战，他们的体格会让他们成为最优秀的士兵。

